Under the hypotheses of Proposition ef{prop:profile-compactness}, suppose in addition that \(
orm{D_u(h_j,m)\psi_j}\) is globally bounded. On a subsequence realizing its lower limit, the profiles satisfy  egin{equation} \sum_{C	ext{ proper}}
orm{D_u^C(m)F_C}^2 \le\liminf_{j	o\infty}
orm{D_u(h_j,m)\psi_j}^2. \end{equation} The derivatives on the left are the full-space graph derivatives.
